{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight alongside an AI that learns your unique <strong>playstyle.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure with a mysterious AI that grows stronger the more you teach it.\u00a0<br><i>BlockWorld Ai</i> is an <strong>AI-training puzzle RPG</strong> where you battle alongside \u201cHoshihabito-kun,\u201d an AI that learns how you solve puzzles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save the Friends who have turned hostile, your wisdom becomes your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The AI Learns from Your Moves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions.\u00a0<br>Your chain reactions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI <strong>remembers them and evolves.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI you raise will operate the puzzle board during boss battles.<br>Using the strategies it has learned, it fights on its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Strategic Puzzle Where Numbers Decide the Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the numbers written on the blocks to subtract from the \u201ctarget number\u201d and bring it down to zero.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the target number reaches zero, a chain reaction is triggered.\u00a0<br>Match three of the same blocks to attack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play, yet deeply strategic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Battles with the AI You Raised</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standing before the boss is the AI you nurtured.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the strategies it has learned, it moves the board and fights on its own.\u00a0<br>Its actions <strong>reflect your playstyle</strong>\u2014fighting with the same judgment you taught it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support it with skills and fight together for victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activate Skills with Diagonal Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align blocks diagonally through the center to activate the Friends\u2019 skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up SP to unleash powerful special moves.\u00a0<br>Turn the tide of battle in an instant!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Treasure Collection &amp; Enhancement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cubes you collect to obtain treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination of growth and strategy unlocks new possibilities for your AI.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Research","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/56fa1907184e7171efee41ad64828ef4fa1441f5.jpg"},{"name":"Friends with the Lab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/972931cbb16bce5a150cbb3e596698f54d080e8c.jpg"},{"name":"Block Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/050c9bd47f0bdab855a376383ec46779d155f90f.jpg"},{"name":"Block Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/92eed293f0516d91e251dbf2da6a3806105c3145.jpg"},{"name":"First Lesson","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/7cde73565207f2c1cd85006246a2fca6a9d175cb.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur Trainer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/22a78d7e400c1d23e8d30a3097d5c973bf8ceb85.jpg"},{"name":"Pro Trainer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/ad1e1e3378831b02fd343c467da09953fa3ef0de.jpg"},{"name":"Master Trainer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/4a933a6f1cff5da80997d6ade18d66de541a4227.jpg"},{"name":"Became Friends with a Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/4fcfaa2454371588508535526306838ff09762a4.jpg"},{"name":"Became Best Friends with a Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3010030/ee099fe2a