number reaches zero, a chain reaction is triggered.\u00a0<br>Match three of the same blocks to attack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play, yet deeply strategic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Battles with the AI You Raised</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standing before the boss is the AI you nurtured.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the strategies it has learned, it moves the board and fights on its own.\u00a0<br>Its actions <strong>reflect your playstyle</strong>\u2014fighting with the same judgment you taught it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support it with skills and fight together for victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activate Skills with Diagonal Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align blocks diagonally through the center to activate the Friends\u2019 skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up SP to unleash powerful special moves.\u00a0<br>Turn the tide of battle in an instant!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Treasure Collection &amp; Enhancement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the cubes you collect to obtain treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination of growth and strategy unlocks new possibilities for your AI.</p>","developers":["One Team."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010030/9efe2f560bfa16a606936fff56ad2c53231dba96/header.jpg?t=1772031695","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3010030/844360114/5057311c4d769d29f7636eb6144f9d87b29f7e49/1765170613/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765303391","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.